window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>Vali has never desired a man, until today. But her curiosity may get her killed.</p> <p></p> <p>When the madam of The Rutting Sow sends innocent Vali on a dangerous errand, she begs an old friend for help. To repay the favor, Vali ends up cleaning chamber pots for an upscale cathouse, The Frisky Kitten.</p> <p></p> <p>She should go straight home, but it’s specials night at the Kitten, and every keyhole opens a world of new, naughty ideas.</p> <p></p> <p>But when a mysterious man catches Vali watching and chases her through the night, she ends up running for her life…. and straight into a trap.</p> <p></p> <p>Mischief, mayhem, and missing servants … is Vali the next to vanish?</p> <p></p> <p>Narrated by Kit Swann, this short story is a prequel to The King’s Omega, a full-length historical fantasy why choose Omegaverse novel. For mature listeners.</p>"; 
